b.com/repos/1123786563/OpenBot/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1123786563/OpenBot/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1123786563/OpenBot/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1123786563/OpenBot/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1123786563/OpenBot/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1123786563/OpenBot/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1123786563/OpenBot/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1123786563/OpenBot/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1123786563/OpenBot/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1123786563/OpenBot/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1123786563/OpenBot/deployments","created_at":"2026-10-09T06:32:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T15:15:48Z","pushed_at":"2026-10-19T15:15:41Z","git_url":"git://github.com/1123786563/OpenBot.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:1123786563/OpenBot.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/1123786563/OpenBot.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/1123786563/OpenBot","homepage":"https://www.copilotkit.ai/openbot","size":119188,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"language":"TypeScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":337,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":337,"watchers":0,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"body":"## Parent\n\nSpec: https://github.com/1123786563/OpenBot/issues/472 — 内置 Agent 执行迁移 Mastra。本 Issue 是其正式子 Issue。\n\n## What to build\n\n用户看到工具动作和参数，批准、拒绝或补充回答；刷新或服务重启后仍能继续准确的待办，不重复执行外部动作。\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] 审批/问答挂起前保存 continuation 与受保护 snapshot 引用，关联当前 scope、Bot、Run/Attempt/generation、稳定 operationId、参数摘要和引擎版本。\n- [ ] 用户看到的动作/参数与实际执行完全一致；篡改参数、他人批准、来源撤权或旧 generation 的恢复被拒绝。\n- [ ] 审批等待和问答等待分别展示 waiting_approval/suspended；只有正式结果持久化及费用确认后才允许 succeeded。\n- [ ] 两个并发恢复者只有一个能获得 CAS claim；重复点击、重复 webhook、刷新和重启不导致已确认外部操作重做。\n- [ ] 合法恢复跨 Attempt 保留 operationId；已完成 receipt 复用，外部可能已生效但结果未知时显示待处置，不自动重放。\n- [ ] 独立进程/实例从持久存储恢复，过期 claim 按 receipt 证据处理；版本不兼容/缺快照明确隔离，不反序列化执行猜测载荷。\n- [ ] 拒绝、过期、停止及存储失败遵守原行为，不能先发布可恢复状态再发现缺恢复数据；日志/快照不泄露模型秘密。\n\n## Blocked by\n\n- https://github.com/1123786563/OpenBot/issues/476 — Bot 通过本人授权的连接器工具完成多步工作\n\n## Scope boundary\n\n通用审批与问答恢复，包含必要 UI；不做任意模型 token 的断点续算，不声称外部系统 exactly-once。\n\n## Interfaces\n\n- Consumes：前置票经审查的实际交付合同，以及父 Spec 的身份、预算、消息与恢复约束。\n- Produces：versioned continuation、恢复 claim/receipt/未知结果合同，客户端等待与恢复事件。\n- Responsibility：backend_implementer / frontend_implementer；相应只读验证者 + 独立 Spec/质量 reviewer。\n\n## Verification\n\n现有审批 UI 的批准/拒绝/问答/刷新流程，另测两个实例抢恢复、落盘间故障、退出重启、撤权及未知副作用。\n\n## Failure handling\n\n无法证明外部效果时待人工或供应商证据核对；不靠新 attempt 自动重复。\n\n## Acceptance mapping\n\n父 Spec：A06, A18, A19。既有实施计划关联：T6, T8, T12。Issue 是完整业务切片，计划 Task 是票内或前置工程步骤，两者不一一等同。\n\n## Handoff notes\n\n- 方案、测试 seam 与拆票已由用户于 2026-10-19 确认，按该范围登记 Issue。ready-for-agent 只表示规格可接手，不表示依赖已完成、已实现或已获上线授权。\n- 使用根 CONTEXT 的术语，遵守公司/团队/本人/逻辑 Bot、计费准入、个人记忆和测试运行器 ADR；不得因框架替换重定权威。\n- 每票保留独立可演示的行为；跨端时先固定事件/状态接口，再按专业角色安排票内实现 Task，不把业务票另拆成数据库/后端/前端水平交付。\n- 领取前核验前置代码及其同哈希验证/Review 已集成；关闭状态不是实现证据，外部引用不是自动扩大的实施范围。\n- 按仓库 writing-plans/SDD/独立 Review/OCR 流程实施；无提交授权用完整未提交增量检查点。该流程在真正实施时适用，本 Issue 登记不启动实现。\n- 验证由 e2e 统一调度，native/driven 清单与实际用例数对账，数据库仅用明确的一次性受限角色 fixture；skip/缺环境/零用例不算通过。\n- 结束或中断记录 HEAD、范围、完整 patch/新增文件及哈希、实际命令与结果、Review 和限制，方便新 Agent 恢复；不擅自提交、推送、合并、生产导入、部署或关闭其他 Issue。\n\n<!-- openbot:mastra-agent-execution:ME05 -->\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1123786563/OpenBot/issues/477/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1123786563/OpenBot/issues/477/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}]]